  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeacherInteraction
  playerMovement: {fileID: 916875898}
  teacherName: Lee
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 1256853252}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1682790333}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - Hello friend.
  - "It\u2019s important to be precise with your rune choice when writing spells."
  - I prepared a task for you to practice.
  - "Take a look at that dying flame. Reignite it, making sure it won\u2019t burn
    out again. Then, turn it to a calm hearth."
  - Look around to create a well-constructed incantation.
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - 'Full points. '
  - "Let\u2019s round things out with a discussion, using magic."
  afterBattleLines:
  - 'You made some good points. '
  - "Here\u2019s a new spell for you."
  afterSpellLines:
  - Good luck, friend.
